! RADICAL ISOMERIZATION (ADD WHEN ECH3J ADDED TO MECH)
! ECH-BJ=ECH3J !1,5 H TRANSFER. 2 POSSIBLE H'S POINT IN AXIAL DIRECTION.
!                !LOOKS LIKELY SINCE THE H BEING ABSTRACTED IN POINT THE SAME AXIAL DIRECTION AS THE ETHYL GROUP
! ATTACHED TO THE RING.  IF IN EQUALATERAL DIRECTION, NO ISOMERIZATION LIKELY.S
!
!NPCH-C
!
CYCHEXCH2+C2H4=NPCH-CJ 1.32E04 2.48 6130.0 ! ADDITION OF A PRIMARY RADICAL TO ETHYLENE
