!
! NOTE: "Q" BELOW DENOTES "OOH" GROUP
! CORRECT FOR ROTORS   LREADY TIED UP  IN RO2 AND O2QOOH ISOMERIZATION BETWEEN THE RING AND THE ALKYL CHAIN?
! WJP: SOME OF THE CARBONYLHYDROPEROXIDES FORMED COULD BE LUMPED TO REDUCE THE NUMBER OF SPECIES
!
! NBCH-1Q-XO2:

! THE FOLLOWING ISOMERIZATIONS ARE NEGLECTED DUE TO NO "WEAK H" TO ABSTRACT ON TERTIARY SITE
! ALTERNATIVE ISOMERIZATIONS CAN BE INCLUDED HERE.
! NBCH-1Q-2O2
! NBCH-1Q-3O2
! NBCH-1Q-4O2
! NBCH-1Q-AO2
! NBCH-1Q-BO2
