NBCH-2Q-1O2=NBCH-2*O-1Q+OH  7.0E-06  4.9 24191.0 ! 5-MEMBERED RING. FERNANDES ET AL. ZADOR, PCCP 2009 FOR CHXO2J => CHX1Q2J, 50 BAR RATE. A-FACTOR/4 (DEG=1 INSTEAD OF 4 AS IN CHX)
! WJP: REDUCE RATE BY 4 BECAUSE THE O-O GROUP COULD BE EITHER AXIAL OR EQUILATERAL.
! ONLY AN EQUILATERAL O-O WILL BE ABLE TO ABSTRACT THE H.  ALSO THE O-O IS EQUILATERAL AND THE H IS AXIAL.
