! REDUCE RATE BECAUSE THE OO GROUP IS AXIAL (ALKYL GROUP IS EQUILATERAL)
! AND THE C-H IS POINTING EQUILATERAL.  REDUCED BY AN ARBITRARY FACTOR OF 2
! NO REDUCTION OF EA BY 3 KCAL DUE TO INCREASED STRAIN IN TST
